# CVE-2026-33180: HAPI FHIR HTTP authentication leak in redirects
# These org.hl7.fhir.* packages (6.6.7) are tightly coupled to hapi-fhir-validation 8.6.6
# and cannot be upgraded independently without AbstractMethodError.
# The vulnerable packages we CAN upgrade (convertors, dstu2, dstu2016may, dstu3, r4b) are
# already overridden to 6.9.0 in pom.xml dependencyManagement.
# Remaining packages (model, support, utilities, r4, r5, validation) require a full
# hapi-fhir major version upgrade to resolve.
